'''''Exacum''''' ({{IPAc-en|ˈ|ɛ|k|s|ə|k|əm}} {{respell|EK|sə|kəm}})<ref>{{cite journal|last1=Klackenberg|first1=Jens|title=The genus Exacum (Gentianaceae).|journal=Opera Bot.|date=1985|volume=84|pages=1–144}}</ref><ref>{{cite journal|last1=Klackenberg|first1=jens|title=Cotylanthera transferred to Exacum (Gentianaceae).|journal=Botanische Jahrbücher|date=2006|volume=126|issue=4|pages=477–481|doi=10.1127/0006-8152/2006/0126-0477}}</ref> is a genus of [[plant]] in family [[Gentianaceae]]. It contains 75 species native to tropical regions of sub-Saharan Africa, southern Arabian Peninsula, south and southeast Asia, New Guinea, and Australia.<ref name = powo/>

